          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 102295,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando precisamos usar código do lado do servidor com nossa página web?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Quando queremos fornecer conteúdo personalizado para o usuário</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Quando queremos exibir uma página com conteúdo que não muda</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Quando queremos estilizar nossos elementos HTML usando CSS</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Quando queremos fornecer conteúdo personalizado para o usuário.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uma página deve mostrar recomendações diferentes para cada usuário conectado. Quando o código do lado do servidor é necessário?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Quando a página oferece conteúdo personalizado para o usuário.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Quando a página exibe conteúdo que não muda.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Quando o CSS estiliza elementos HTML.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Quando a página oferece conteúdo personalizado para o usuário.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 102297,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual desses cenários exigiria uma conexão com um servidor?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Reservando um hotel a partir de uma lista de opções</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Exibindo o endereço de um hotel</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Usando uma fonte específica para o texto de uma página web</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Reservando um hotel a partir de uma lista de opções.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual ação em uma página de hotel precisa de conexão com um servidor porque depende de dados atuais selecionados pelo usuário?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Reservando um hotel a partir de uma lista de opções</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Exibindo o endereço de um hotel</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Usar uma fonte específica no texto da página</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Reservando um hotel a partir de uma lista de opções.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 102298,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual protocolo os navegadores usam para solicitar dados específicos do usuário de um servidor?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">HTTP</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">DNS</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">HTML</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher HTTP.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um navegador precisa solicitar dados de uma conta a um servidor. Qual protocolo transporta essa solicitação?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">HTTP</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">DNS</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">HTML</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">O método <code>POST</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher HTTP.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Server side",
            "id": 102338,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>De que é responsável o código frontend ou do lado do cliente?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Exibindo as informações personalizadas solicitadas do backend</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Armazenando informações específicas do usuário</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Executando algoritmos complexos</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Exibindo as informações personalizadas solicitadas do backend.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O backend retorna os dados corretos do perfil, mas a página ainda mostra o perfil antigo. O que o frontend deve fazer depois?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Atualizar o perfil exibido usando os dados recebidos.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Manter a exibição antiga porque receber os dados conclui a tarefa.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Alterar o perfil armazenado no banco de dados do servidor.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Atualizar o perfil exibido usando os dados recebidos.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Banking",
            "id": 102339,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Que tipo de solicitações o frontend de um aplicativo de mídia social faz ao fazer login?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Solicitações para as postagens mais recentes, a foto de perfil do usuário ou mensagens privadas</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Solicitações para as regras padrão de CSS para a página</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Solicitações para os elementos HTML exibidos na página</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Solicitações para as postagens mais recentes, a foto de perfil do usuário ou mensagens privadas.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mia sai e Leo entra no mesmo site social. O layout e os estilos não mudam. O que o frontend deve solicitar para Leo?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">As publicações, a foto de perfil e as mensagens privadas de Leo.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Apenas as regras CSS compartilhadas do site.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Os dados de Mia novamente, mudando apenas o nome no topo.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">As publicações, a foto de perfil e as mensagens privadas de Leo.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 119361,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como uma <code>API</code> pode realizar diferentes ações?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Diferentes métodos de requisição para a <code>API</code> podem realizar diferentes ações</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Uma <code>API</code> pode realizar apenas uma ação</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">A <code>API</code> tem vontade própria e é inteligente o suficiente para realizar muitas ações</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Diferentes métodos de requisição para a <code>API</code> podem realizar diferentes ações.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O mesmo endpoint de API pode ler dados em uma solicitação e criar dados em outra. O que permite essas ações diferentes?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Métodos de solicitação diferentes podem acionar ações diferentes.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Uma API só pode realizar uma ação.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Uma API adivinha automaticamente a ação desejada.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Métodos de solicitação diferentes podem acionar ações diferentes.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 132283,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Escreva uma requisição <code>GET</code> para <code>https://localhost:3000/menu</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"bash\" name=\"script.sh\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"GET https://localhost:3000/menu HTTP/3\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ROUTE\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>GET</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Solicite o menu de <code>https://localhost:3000/menu</code> sem alterar dados do servidor. Use o método HTTP que recupera dados.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"bash\" name=\"script.sh\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"GET https://localhost:3000/menu HTTP/3\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ROUTE\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"POST\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"FETCH\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>GET</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 119362,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Use <code>fetch</code> para chamar o endpoint <code>/menu</code> no localhost.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"fetch(\" /><text value=\"&quot;http://localhost:3000/menu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\").then(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"response\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" { \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;API Request successfully sent!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"); \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"get\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"app\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>fetch</code> seguido de <code>\"http://localhost:3000/menu\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Use <code>fetch</code> para solicitar o menu ao servidor local na porta <code>3000</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"fetch(\" /><text value=\"&quot;http://localhost:3000/menu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\").then(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"response\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" { \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;API Request successfully sent!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"); \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"get\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"app\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;/menu&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>fetch</code> seguido de <code>\"http://localhost:3000/menu\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 119365,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual é o método correto para solicitar dados de um servidor?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>GET</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>BRING</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>DELIVER</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>GET</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um cliente precisa recuperar uma lista de produtos sem alterá-la. Qual método de solicitação é adequado?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>GET</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>BRING</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>DELIVER</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">O método <code>POST</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>GET</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 4",
            "id": 119366,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Requerer o framework Express.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"); \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express(); \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/menu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; { \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Here is your menu!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"); \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}); \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(\" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", () =&gt; { \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Server is running on port 3000&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"); \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"32\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Server is running on port 3000\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>express</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: URL",
            "id": 102366,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Conclua o endpoint <code>GET</code> para <code>/menu</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/menu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Here is your menu!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(\" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Server is running on port 3000&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"send\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>app</code> seguido de <code>get</code> e finalmente <code>\"/menu\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Trate uma solicitação de leitura do menu feita pelo navegador. Use <code>app</code> para registrar uma rota <code>GET</code> em <code>/menu</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/menu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Here is your menu!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(\" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Server is running on port 3000&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"send\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;/food&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>app</code> seguido de <code>get</code> e finalmente <code>\"/menu\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Accept Headers",
            "id": 102972,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Certifique-se de que o servidor está ouvindo as solicitações recebidas.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/menu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Here is your menu!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(\" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Server is running on port 3000&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"135\" endIndex=\"141\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"start\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Server is running on port 3000\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>listen</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A rota do menu está pronta. Complete a chamada que faz este app Express aceitar solicitações recebidas na porta <code>3000</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/menu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Here is your menu!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(\" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Server is running on port 3000&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"135\" endIndex=\"141\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"start\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"get\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"send\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Server is running on port 3000\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>listen</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Request line 2",
            "id": 102962,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual endpoint podemos chamar ao executar este servidor?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/menu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Here is your menu!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(\" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Server is running on port 3000&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Server is running on port 3000\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>/menu</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>/</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>/get</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>/menu</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Você muda o caminho da rota de <code>/menu</code> para <code>/dishes</code> sem alterar o método. Qual solicitação corresponde agora?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/menu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Here is your menu!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(\" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Server is running on port 3000&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Server is running on port 3000\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">GET /dishes</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">GET /menu</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">POST /dishes</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">GET /get</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher GET /dishes.</p></body></html>",
